  "method": "Use prior-session USD10y yield plus assumed operating-beta times dated January impliedERP as a hypothetical all-equity operating discount rate; beta1.2/1.6/2.0 years1\u20135 fades to1 byyear10. Hold rf/ERP unchanged through forecast solely for isolation. Retain original growth/margins/capital/taxes. Use original actual debt bridge, but this proxy omits financing tax-shield effects and is not a reconstructed levered WACC.",
