    "Treasury history is currently published historical data, not certified as-released archive.",
    "No debt market weights, credit-spread reconstruction or bottom-up comparable beta supplied.",
    "Mature beta1 is an assumption, not demonstrated business convergence.",
    "Results reflect the rate mechanism alone; greater uncertainty would warrant broader business states as well."
